{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2023-02-21 14:41:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY TO MOBILIZE FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND MICROGRID-INTEGRATED FLEET ELECTRIFICATION CENTER', 'text': 'PART OF A BROADER COLLABORATIVE EFFORT TO ELECTRIFY AND DECARBONIZE TRANSPORTATION FLEETS CHARLOTTE, N.C. , FEB. 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUKE ENERGY HAS ANNOUNCED IT WILL BUILD A FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND PERFORMANCE CENTER THAT WILL MODEL AND ACCELERATE THE DEVELOPMENT, TESTING AND DEPLOYMENT OF ZERO-EMISSIONS LIGHT-, MEDIUM- AND HEAVY-DUTY COMMERCIAL ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) FLEETS.'}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2023-02-20 12:59:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY, PASCO-HERNANDO STATE COLLEGE SPOTLIGHT EFFORTS TO ELEVATE NEXT GENERATION OF ENGINEERING PROFESSIONALS DURING NATIONAL ENGINEERS WEEK', 'text': 'NATIONAL ENGINEERS WEEK, FEB 19-25, HIGHLIGHTS THE IMPORTANCE OF ENGINEERING AND TECHNOLOGY PROFESSIONALS RECENT GRANT PROVIDES SCHOLARSHIP ASSISTANCE TO 20 ENGINEERING/DRAFTING STUDENTS AT PASCO-HERNANDO STATE COLLEGE ST. PETERSBURG, FLA.'}